parts.text:
We need implement B4. Need read AGENTS.md and current files/config. Must not add deps, not touch src/api, not write business tests. We need create:
- src/config/env.ts
- src/pages/base.page.ts
- src/components/header.component.ts
- src/pages/home.page.ts, login.page.ts, register.page.ts, cart.page.ts
- src/data/user.factory.ts + src/utils/random.ts
- src/fixtures/test.fixtures.ts
- tests/e2e/navigation.spec.ts
- update playwright.config.ts forbidOnly true always
- docs 02 text replacements
- docs 04 date closure
- docs/evidencias/B4/README.md
- docs/README, README, AGENTS B4 [x] only if gate passes
- run typecheck, lint, npm.cmd test, npx.cmd playwright test --list
- commit exact message.

Need understand site selectors. We have some from B2/B3:
- Header: Register link, Log in link, Shopping cart (n), Wishlist (n), Log out, account email (when authenticated) maybe link with class account. Need implement methods.
- Home page: title "Demo Web Shop", cart counter; maybe header component.
- LoginPage: /login, Email textbox, Password, Log in button, error summary maybe getter. login(email,password).
- RegisterPage: /register, fields First name, Last name, Email, Password, Confirm password, Register button; register(user). Also maybe gender optional. Need TestUser type.
